usage: analyze_lean_whnf_classified.py [-h] --run RUN [--label LABEL]
                                       --inputs INPUTS --reference REFERENCE
                                       --out OUT

Reconstruct native classified WHNF source intervals from ordinary raw logs. No
verifier launch. Missing begin/complete intervals remain censored. These
instrumented calling-thread counters do not establish GPU support or speedup.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --run RUN
  --label LABEL
  --inputs INPUTS
  --reference REFERENCE
  --out OUT
